{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Notice that this expression has the following special form:\n\n$(a+b)(a+b)=(a+b)^2$\n\nThis form is what we call \"a perfect square\":\n\n$(\\blueD a+\\maroonC b)^2=\\blueD a^2+2\\blueD a\\maroonC b+\\maroonC b^2$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}(7x-1)^2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\big(\\blueD{7x}+(\\maroonC{-1})\\big)^2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=(\\blueD{7x})^2+2(\\blueD{7x})(\\maroonC{-1})+(\\maroonC{-1})^2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=49x^2-14x+1\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Expand.**  \n*If necessary, combine like terms.*\n\n$(7x-1)^2=$ [[☃ expression 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":true,"key":0,"simplify":false,"value":"49x^2-14x+1"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
